Project Title
  Security Guard Interview for PSHS-EVCL

Problem Statement
  Though the security in PSHS-EVCL is satisfactory, the students have recently faced a slight scare. To prevent future threats and to strengthen the security of the school, this program aims to see if there are willing participants out there that are qualified to be a security guard of PSHS-EVCL.

Project Objectives
  This project will interview willing participants to see if they are qualified to become a security guard of PSHS-EVCL.

Planned Features
  1.Start the program
  2.Ask for the user’s guard interview information.
  3.Search for suitable status of the user.
  4.Filter accesibility based on the user’s preferences.
  5.Show background information related to the interview's inputs.

Planned Inputs and Outputs
  Inputs:
    Name, age, address, phone number, years of work experience

  Output:
    "Congratulations, you are qualified to become a security guard at PSHS-EVCL!"

